      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROBIN CARGO (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 19.97 beating Private Jake. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Expected to go well again. PESSIMISM (5) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 340m at this track two runs back then settled forward again when finishing second at this track last start. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature again. ROYMAN (4) was unfancied last time out but hit the ground running to lead all the way, scoring by 3.5 lengths (19.75) at this track in a Mix 2/3 over 340m. Leading chance again. LITTLE MISS ANDO (8) has a solid strike rate from this box.",
